      "start_s": 23.84,
      "end_s": 30.79,
      "wav_path": "/home/antigravity/rradkch-svg/CTS/episodios/ep01_elevator_safety_brake/cache/tts/b05_governor_intro_d8595d3cae1e.wav",
      "narration_text": "Even better, a separate safety rope loops around a spinning rooftop flywheel called an overspeed governor."
    },
    {
      "id": "b06_what_if_all_cut",
      "start_s": 30.99,
      "end_s": 37.04,
      "wav_path": "/home/antigravity/rradkch-svg/CTS/episodios/ep01_elevator_safety_brake/cache/tts/b06_what_if_all_cut_fc95ae3484d2.wav",
      "narration_text": "Now imagine a freak failure cuts all eight cables at once. Pure mechanics takes over."
    },
    {
      "id": "b07_centrifugal_trip",
      "start_s": 37.29,
      "end_s": 43.79,
      "wav_path": "/home/antigravity/rradkch-svg/CTS/episodios/ep01_elevator_safety_brake/cache/tts/b07_centrifugal_trip_c6a14b2be9df.wav",
      "narration_text": "The moment the cab speeds up fifteen percent too fast, spring-loaded flyweights swing out and lock the flywheel."
    },
    {
      "id": "b08_rope_yank_linkage",
      "start_s": 44.09,
      "end_s": 49.9,
      "wav_path": "/home/antigravity/rradkch-svg/CTS/episodios/ep01_elevator_safety_brake/cache/tts/b08_rope_yank_linkage_c1e445661204.wav",
      "narration_text": "No computers, no power needed. That stopped rope yanks steel linkage bars underneath the cabin."
    },
    {
      "id": "b09_wedge_clamp_physics",
      "start_s": 50.15,
      "end_s": 57.1,
      "wav_path": "/home/antigravity/rradkch-svg/CTS/episodios/ep01_elevator_safety_brake/cache/tts/b09_wedge_clamp_physics_dc1890828cef.wav",
      "narration_text": "Those bars jam hardened steel wedges into the vertical guide rails. The harder gravity pulls, the tighter they bite."
